  "description": "Test build of Gwen's A Thousand Cuts (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Gwen so every passive hit on an enemy champion deals 1% (+0.3% per 100 AP) of the champion's maximum health as magic damage, reduced by magic resistance, read from the game, instead of the data pack's stand-in (1% of maximum health as true damage). The heal and the flat magic damage are unchanged. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
